==Description==
'''Molten Rage''' is a sticker obtained from Lieutenant II rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the [[Molten Warlord]] holding up its fist while angered. When used, it plays a sound of the [[Molten Warlord]] taunting.

==Update History==
*'''23 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0]]
**'''Molten Rage''' added.
**{{Bug}} Does not play its sound when used.
*'''24 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0|v1.71.4a]]
**{{Bugfix}} Now plays its sound.
*'''22 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0|v1.77.5a]]
**'''Molten Rage''' is no longer obtainable.



